<section image-layout="blank" id="eSTVyqpTmT"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="GnrWcibA7l" padding="42pt 48pt 24pt" colspan="45"><h2>Underwriting starts with classification</h2><p>UNEP’s 2023 assessment projects return to 1980 ozone levels <b>if current policies remain in place</b>.</p><grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="DfNs6bJx4H" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><p font-size="30pt"><b>2040</b> <span font-size="14pt">Global</span></p></grid-item><grid-item id="aEH1bbMg11" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><p font-size="30pt"><b>2045</b> <span font-size="14pt">Arctic</span></p></grid-item><grid-item id="HqcRfsupIg" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><p font-size="30pt"><b>2066</b> <span font-size="14pt">Antarctica</span></p></grid-item></grid><table col-widths="[14,34,52]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding: 4pt 7pt; font-size: 15pt; line-height: 1.25;"><tbody><tr><td><p>Class</p></td><td><p>Science and policy</p></td><td><p>Investment read-through</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>ODS</b></p></td><td><p>Depletes ozone; Montreal Protocol phaseout.</p></td><td><p>Test installed base, servicing, recovery and disposal.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>HFC</b></p></td><td><p>Warms climate; does not deplete ozone. Kigali is related but distinct.</p></td><td><p>Test replacement timing, supply, capex and resilience.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Unknown</b></p></td><td><p>No reliable classification yet.</p></td><td><p>Verify substance, use and jurisdiction before pricing.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p font-size="13pt"><b>Legal boundary:</b> the supplied sources establish global treaty architecture, not current jurisdiction-specific compliance dates. <b>Sources:</b> <a href="https://www.unep.org/news-and-stories/press-release/ozone-layer-recovery-track-helping-avoid-global-warming-05degc">UNEP 2023 assessment summary</a>; <a href="https://ozone.unep.org/treaties/montreal-protocol">Montreal Protocol</a>.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="dGMReiSQ9I" padding="0" colspan="15"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/gADT1E7M2xArfmm0FEgym.png" saved-media-id="hrz3589y8ki6rl2" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="industrial-atmospheric-relief" alt="Precision editorial relief cross-section of layered stratosphere above an abstract refrigeration system, a compressor and coiled tubing connected beneath translucent mineral-paper atmospheric bands, oxidized metal details, cool raking light, exposure blue and transition teal with one restrained rust signal, no text, no lettering, no logos" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item></grid></section>